---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/electoral-roll.html
title: The Electoral Roll
subtitle: 'If you worship with us regularly, joining the electoral roll is a simple way to say: Emmanuel is
  my church.'
intro_content: >-
  The electoral roll is how we keep track of how many people think of themselves as members of Emmanuel Church.


  It also helps the Diocese calculate the amount of money we pay towards central church costs. To elect new members to the Parochial Church Council or the Deanery Synod, you need to be on the electoral roll.


  If you worship with us on a regular basis, please consider joining the Electoral Roll — we would be glad to count you among our members.
aside_heading: Join the roll
aside_body: Complete and return an Application for Enrolment form, available below or from the parish
  office.
callout:
  - heading: Make Emmanuel your church home.
    body: Joining the electoral roll is quick and simple — and it lets you take a full part in the
      life and decisions of the parish.
    primary_button:
      - label: Download the form
        href: https://parishresources.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Form-1-Application-for-enrolment-church-electoral-roll.pdf
    secondary_button:
      - label: New to Emmanuel?
        href: im-new.html
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>Electoral Roll — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <section class="em-pagehead em-pagehead--band em-pagehead--plain">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><a href="community-outreach.html">Get Involved</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Electoral Roll</span></div>
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
      <p class="deck">{{ subtitle }}</p>

    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="em-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <div data-editable="text" data-prop="intro_content" data-type="html">
          {% for para in intro_content.split("\n\n") %}<p>{{ para | trim | safe }}</p>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4>{{ aside_heading }}</h4>
          <p>{{ aside_body }}</p>
          <a href="https://parishresources.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Form-1-Application-for-enrolment-church-electoral-roll.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-bottom:12px">Enrolment form (PDF)</a>
          <a href="contact.html" class="em-readmore">Questions? Contact the office →</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% for c in callout %}
  <section class="em-callout">
    <div class="inner">
      <div><h3 data-editable="text" data-prop="heading" data-type="span">{{ c.heading }}</h3><p data-editable="text" data-prop="body" data-type="text">{{ c.body }}</p></div>
      {% if (c.primary_button and c.primary_button.length) or (c.secondary_button and c.secondary_button.length) %}
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        {% for btn in c.primary_button %}<a href="{{ btn.href }}"{% if btn.href | isExternal %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %} class="em-btn em-btn--tan">{{ btn.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
        {% for btn in c.secondary_button %}<a href="{{ btn.href }}"{% if btn.href | isExternal %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %} class="em-btn em-btn--ghost-light">{{ btn.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
